Input schema: {'text': 'str'}
Output schema:
entities: List[Entity]

Entity:
  text: string  # The matched text span
  start: integer  # Start character offset
  end: integer  # End character offset
  type: string  # Entity label

AVAILABLE ENTITY TYPES: ['person']
Rules MUST use one of these types in output_template.


DATA EVIDENCE FROM TRAINING:
- person (15 unique): "Mag. Andrea Ebner", "Henriette Fricks", "Dr.in Adelheid Dworaczek", "Kai Rothenfusser", "OStR RgR Lubomir Repp", "Mag. Hartwig Franz Allmaier", "Hon.-Prof. Arthur Laurenzi", "KommR Lynn Bickle", "Dr.in Sascha Bonn", "Ilona Kleine-B\u00f6rger", "Dr. Peter Steurer", "Yelec Nitzge", "Mag. Manuela Fischer", "Ing. Leroy Girnu\u00df", "Mag. Dimitri Tezloff"
